<CaseStudy
  name="1stdibs Contemporary"
  tagline="brought the best contemporary designers to buyers all over the world."
  shareImage="contemporary-landing-3"
>
  <p slot="meta">Product Designer • Responsive web • 2017</p>

  <Figure images={[{ name: 'contemporary-landing-3', alt: '1stdibs Contemporary landing page' }]} eager />

  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>
      I designed a site that connected buyers with makers of contemporary luxury goods such as furniture, art, and
      jewelry.
    </h2>
    <p>
      1stdibs is a luxury marketplace that seeks to bring the most beautiful objects to buyers all over the world. While
      1stdibs has previously been focused on antiques, vintage objects, and fine art, the company recently has been
      adjusting its strategy to include contemporary designers and makers. I was tasked with designing a landing page
      that would act as a product showcase and homepage for 1stdibs.com. I designed the entire Contemporary Design
      homepage experience from establishing requirements with stakeholders all the way through to overseeing
      development.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Figure images={[{ name: 'contemporary-modules', alt: 'Customizable CMS modules' }]} tight />
  <Figure images={[{ name: 'contemporary-mobile', alt: '1stdibs Contemporary on mobile' }]} />
</CaseStudy>
